fact WorkItem(id: "WI-684", description: some(value: "Follow-up to WI-505: relocate the canonical anthill.stage0 domain/rules bundle asset OUT of the live tracker dir into a dedicated bundle-asset location, resolving the 'three-roles file' flagged in WI-505 review. CURRENT STATE (WI-505, delivered): anthill_bundle.rs include_str!s the repo-root anthill-todo/domain.anthill + rules.anthill (../../../ reach). That single file now plays THREE roles: (1) the binary's bundled domain, (2) this repo's own tracker project file scanned at runtime then skipped via is_bundled_domain_or_rules, (3) test fixture for 7 anthill-core tests (wi204_sort_param/wi204_smoke/wi204_let_ctor_env/wi210_dispatch/wi219_modify_transitivity/wi236_call_with_requirements/wi237_diag). Footgun: editing the live tracker file rebuilds the shipped binary; and the tracker dir keeps hitting the skip path on every CLI run. FIX: create rustland/anthill-todo/anthill/domain.anthill + rules.anthill (beside version/store/main), point anthill_bundle.rs at ../anthill/domain.anthill + ../anthill/rules.anthill, DELETE the repo-root anthill-todo/domain.anthill + rules.anthill, and repoint the 7 anthill-core fixtures + tests/common/mod.rs setup_project copy-source to rustland/anthill-todo/anthill/. Result: ONE canonical bundle-asset copy decoupled from the live tracker dir; the repo's own anthill-todo/ becomes a normal domain-less project (dogfoods WI-505). CONSTRAINTS: (a) preserve file content byte-for-byte on the move so the 7 fixtures behave identically; (b) the examples/github-todo/ copy stays (separate github_todo_test fixture) but note it still uses the older all_deps_verified rules vs the bundled tracker all_deps_satisfied -- decide whether to reconcile the example or leave it as an intentional standalone illustration. ACCEPTANCE: repo-root anthill-todo/ has NO domain.anthill/rules.anthill; anthill-todo + anthill-core suites green; anthill-todo running against the repo tracker shows no skip/parse notes. Rust-only, mechanical."), context: none, acceptance: [ToolPasses(tool: "cargo-test", params: none)], depends_on: some(value: nil), generates: none, requires_capability: none, status: Delivered(agent: "claude", at: "2026-07-11T18:35:42Z"))
